job_description:
Position: Process Engineer (Ironbridge Manufacturing)
Responsibilities:
1. Prepare and maintain process documents;
2. Support pilot runs and process validation;
3. Analyze quality issues and propose improvements;
4. Confirm tooling requirements with production.
Requirements:
1. Degree in mechanical or materials engineering;
2. Familiar with engineering drawing and tolerances;
3. Comfortable working on the shop floor;
4. Improvement project experience preferred.
